  {
   "type": "heading",
   "level": 2,
   "text": "Hypothesizing and Concluding 「わけ、〜とする」"
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "text": "In this section, we're going to learn how to make hypotheses and reach conclusions using: 「とする」 and 「わけ」(訳)."
  },
  {
   "type": "heading",
   "level": 3,
   "text": "Coming to a conclusion with 「わけ」"
  },
  {
   "type": "heading",
   "level": 4,
   "text": "Vocabulary"
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "text": "1. 訳【わけ】- meaning; reason; can be deduced"
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "text": "2. 直子【なお・こ】- Naoko (first name)"
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "text": "3. いくら - how much"
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "text": "4. 英語【えい・ご】- English (language)"
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "text": "5. 勉強【べん・きょう】- study"
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "text": "6. する (exception) - to do"
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "text": "7. うまい (i-adj) - skillful; delicious"
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "text": "8. なる (u-verb) - to become"
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "text": "9. つまり - in short"
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "text": "10. 語学【ご・がく】- language study"
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "text": "11. 能力【のう・りょく】- ability"
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "text": "12. ある (u-verb) - to exist (inanimate)"
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "text": "13. 言う【い・う】(u-verb) - to say"
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "text": "14. 失礼【しつ・れい】- discourtesy"
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "text": "15. 中国語【ちゅう・ごく・ご】- Chinese language"
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "text": "16. 読む【よ・む】(u-verb) - to read"
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "text": "17. 広子【ひろ・こ】- Hiroko (first name)"
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "text": "18. 家【1) うち; 2) いえ】- 1) one's own home; 2) house"
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "text": "19. 行く【い・く】(u-verb) - to go"
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "text": "20. こと - event, matter"
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "text": "21. 一郎【いち・ろう】- Ichirou (first name)"
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "text": "22. 微積分【び・せき・ぶん】- (differential and integral) calculus"
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "text": "23. 分かる【わ・かる】(u-verb) - to understand"
  }
 ]
}